  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Gear up for cold-weather adventures and wet trails in style with the Nike Vomero Roam. Featuring layers of textile and suede on the upper, these shoes bring durability and comfort in a fit that’s hard to resist. The water-repellent finish, together with durable materials, keeps both your feet and shoes fresh, dry, and shielded from the elements. The rubber mudguard maximizes protection from dirt and puddles, while the lightweight High Abrasion Rubber Tech (HART) outsole keeps you well-gripped on wet surfaces. Say yes to the winter plans and spread the cheer with the Nike Vomero Roam.</p> <p><strong>Nike Vomero Roam features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Pull tabs enable easy on and off.</li> <li>Reflective details ensure low-light visibility.</li> <li>Lace toggle with a hook offers an adjustable fit.</li> <li>Chunky foam midsole gives a visible boost of comfort and style.</li> <li>Nike Air Zoom units provide cushioning and energy return.</li> <li>Rubber outsole offers durable traction.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).<br />**HART (High Abrasion Rubber Tech) outsole uses less rubber compound than the brand’s other XDR rubber technologies—without sacrificing durability and abrasion resistance. Less material helps make the outsole lighter and more flexible.</p><hr /><p>Cold mornings, rainy commutes, and weekend plans call for a sneaker that looks polished and handles the elements. The Nike Vomero Roam brings a weather-ready spin to the Vomero line with a water-repellent finish, durable textile and suede layers, and plush cushioning that helps keep every step comfortable from the sidewalk to the trailhead.</p><ul><li>Water-repellent upper helps keep feet dry in wet conditions.</li><li>Rubber mudguard adds extra protection from puddles, dirt, and debris.</li><li>Chunky foam midsole with Nike Air Zoom units delivers cushioned comfort.</li><li>Lace toggle and hook create an easy-to-adjust fit.</li><li>Pull tabs and reflective details round out the functional design.</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size. If you prefer a little extra room or typically wear wider widths, a half-size up may feel more comfortable, especially through the forefoot.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for rainy-day errands, cool-weather commutes, travel, and casual wear when you want everyday comfort with extra weather protection.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p><p>With its chunky sole, layered materials, and streamlined toggle-lace setup, this pair brings a rugged, modern look to everyday outfits. Reviewers love how easily it pairs with joggers, leggings, denim, and other casual staples while still feeling ready for changing weather.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>The sturdy upper and rubber mudguard earn strong marks for holding up through rain, puddles, and regular wear. Some shoppers note a firmer feel at first, but many say the shoe becomes more comfortable after a few wears as it molds in.</p> <p><strong>Care & Maintenance</strong></p><p>A quick wipe-down after wet or muddy outings helps keep the upper looking fresh, and the rubberized lower portion makes cleanup easier. Let the shoes air-dry naturally after heavy exposure to rain or slush.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Roam - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>HQ2181-004</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36</td><td style='padding:6